For {VARIANT:OpenAI|the API} access, you'd typically:
1. Go to {VARIANT:platform.openai.com/api-keys|the provider's dashboard|your account settings}
2. Generate a new key with appropriate permissions
3. Store it in {VARIANT:a secrets manager like AWS Secrets Manager, HashiCorp Vault, or Azure Key Vault|your `.env` file (never committed to version control)|your CI/CD secret store}

